      "target": "perf 分支栈过滤测试脚本 test_brstack.sh",
      "change": "在 perf script 命令管道中添加 sed 命令，删除输出中的空行。",
      "effect_or_reason": "修复因双空格导致空行，从而使后续逆 grep 测试失败的问题，确保测试稳定通过。",
      "context_used": [],
      "source_breakdown": {
        "shared_support": [
          "修改在测试脚本的管道中添加 sed '/^[[:space:]]*$/d' 以删除空行。",
          "commit message 说明空行导致逆 grep 测试失败，需要去除空行。"
        ],
        "message_only_details": [
          "提及空行是由于 perf script 命令中空格被转换为换行符，双空格导致空行。"
        ],
        "code_only_details": []
      },
      "evidence": [
        "patch 显示在 tools/perf/tests/shell/test_brstack.sh 的 test_filter 函数中，将 'perf script ... | tr ' ' '\\n'' 改为 'perf script ... | tr ' ' '\\n' | sed '/^[[:space:]]*$/d''。",
        "commit message 明确指出：'In the perf script command, spaces are turned into newlines. But when there is a double space this results in empty lines which fail the following inverse grep test, so strip the empty lines.'"
